{title: Mighty Warriors}
{subtitle: 1 Chronicles 8:39; 8:40; 8:1–40; 8:33–39}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [F/A] | [Gm] [Eb] |
| [F] | [Bb] | [F/A] | [Eb] [F] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Ner fathered Kish, Kish fathered [F/A]Saul
Saul fa[Gm]thered Jonathan [Eb]and Malchis[Bb]hua
Abina[Eb]dab and Eshbaal [Gm]came
The line of [Eb]kings in Benjamin's [F]name
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Jonathan brought forth Me-rib-[F]baal
[Gm]Micah was born to Me-rib-[Dm]baal
[Eb]Pithon, Melech, [Bb]Tarea, A[Gm]haz
Ahaz [Eb]fathered Je[F]hoaddah's [Bb]gaze
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Jehoaddah had Alemeth [F]there
Az[Gm]maveth and Zimri were [Dm]fair
Zimri [Eb]fathered Moza, it is said
[Bb]Moza fathered [Gm]Binea, so [F]laid
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Bb]Raphah was his son, Elea[F]sah
[Gm]Azel his son, the days that [Dm]pass
[Eb]Azel had six sons, [Bb]names we [Gm]know
[Eb]Azrikam, Boc[F]heru, in the [Bb]flow
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Bb] | [F] | [Gm] | [Dm] |
| [Eb] | [Bb] [Gm] | [Eb] [F] | [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadi[F]ah
Ha[Gm]nan completed the family's [Dm]tie
The [Eb]sons of Eshek his [Bb]brother [Gm]stood
[Eb]Ulam his firstborn, [F]Jeush understood
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
[Bb]Jeush the second, Eliphelet [F]third
The [Gm]sons of Ulam, mighty and [Dm]firm
[Eb]Archers who drew the [Bb]bow with [Gm]might
Many [Eb]sons and [F]grandsons, [Bb]day and night
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 7}
One hundred and fifty in [F]all
A[Gm]mong the sons of Benjamin they [Dm]dwell
The [Eb]register keeps their [Bb]names a[Gm]live
In the [Eb]tribal [F]history, they [Bb]thrive
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Eb]All these were a[F]mong the sons of Benja[Bb]min
{end_of_verse}
